<title>USA: Santa Fe says 3.78 mln prfrd shrs tendered.</title>
<headline>Santa Fe says 3.78 mln prfrd shrs tendered.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santa Fe Energy Resources said on Wednesday that it has accepted for purchase 3,776,056 shares of its convertible preferred stock, seven percent series, for $92.5 million.</p>
<p>The company's cash tender offer for up to 4.5 million of the shares expired midnight November 19, Santa Fe Energy said.</p>
<p>The offer, which commenced on October 22, 1996, specified a purchase price of $24.50 per preferred share, the company said.</p>
</text>
